{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18086","headline":"赠别元十八协律六首 四 · 韩愈","name":"赠别元十八协律六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"势要情所重，排斥则埃尘。\n骨肉未免然，又况四海人。\n嶷嶷桂林伯，矫矫义勇身。\n生平所未识，待我逾交亲。\n遗我数幅书，继以药物珍。\n药物防瘴疠，书劝养形神。\n不知四罪地，岂有再起辰。\n穷途致感激，肝胆还轮囷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}